          "blockId": "[\"rerank\",2]",
          "anchor": "rerank",
          "quote": "Reranking is one call per post. The request holds all candidates with their blocks (about 20,600 characters on average), and the answer is a list of 0 to 4 picks, best first. Each pick gives the target, a relation type, one Korean sentence and the index of one block on each side. An empty list is a valid answer, and 14 posts got one.",
